{
 "task_id": "vts-034-healthline-vivitrol-recommended-dose",
 "task_name": "On healthline.com, find the usual recommended Vivitrol dosage and leave the supporting Vivitrol dosage article open. Return only a JSON object with numeric dose_mg (milligrams per injection), numeric interval_weeks (weeks between injections), and route (the medical administration route in English).",
